.nh
.TH "RAIL0" "1" "Aug 2026" "rail0 CLI" ""

.SH NAME
rail0-admin-payouts-destinations - Every account's payout destinations, read-only (lists when run bare)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrail0 admin payouts destinations [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the payout destinations of every account: each with its account, wallet, chain,
token, address, label and status (unverified, verified, disabled), who registered it and
who confirmed it.

.PP
Read-only: every payout write is the destination wallet's own, and the gateway holds no
funds. With the payouts feature off on this gateway the command answers 404
('rail0 admin config payouts' says whether it is on).


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--account\fP=""
	Only this account's destinations (account id)

.PP
\fB--chain\fP=
	Only destinations on this chain: a slug (arc, base, …) or a chain id; the environment's gateway decides testnet vs mainnet

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for destinations

.PP
\fB--page\fP=0
	Page number (1-based)

.PP
\fB--per-page\fP=0
	Destinations per page

.PP
\fB--sort\fP=""
	Sort by created_at, updated_at, label or status (prefix - for descending)

.PP
\fB--status\fP=""
	Filter by status: unverified, verified, disabled

.PP
\fB--wallet\fP=""
	Only this wallet's destinations (wallet id)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--agent\fP[=false]
	Agent mode: one JSON envelope on stdout, JSON events on stderr, no prompts (env: RAIL0_AGENT=1)

.PP
\fB--base-url\fP=""
	RAIL0 gateway base URL (env: RAIL0_BASE_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Print HTTP request/response details to stderr

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Force plain (uncolored) JSON output (useful in scripts)

.PP
\fB--pretty\fP[=false]
	Use the key-value/table view instead of JSON (terminal only)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Print only the result's id/hash, one per line (useful in scripts)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  rail0 admin payouts destinations --status unverified --pretty
  rail0 admin payouts destinations --account 019e748b-…
  rail0 admin payouts destinations get 01a3e9b1-…
  rail0 admin payouts destinations events 01a3e9b1-…
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBrail0-admin-payouts(1)\fP, \fBrail0-admin-payouts-destinations-events(1)\fP, \fBrail0-admin-payouts-destinations-get(1)\fP
